                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "+Wack-A-Mole\n+Fun\n+Cute\n\n-Need gigantic play area\n-Pricey for little gameplay\n-Gets more annoying and tedious than fun\n\n2/5\n\nAt first it seems like an alright wack a mole game, though ends up a shake your controller game as there are way too many moles to just wack, instead you end up aimlessly hitting hoping you're hitting all of them. The little powerup/power down things are more of a hindrance and annoying then making the game actually fun. \n\nFor how little is actually in this game and how much it costs I wouldn't recommend it to anyone.\n\nIf you liked this review [url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/33220185-VR-Games-and-Tools/]Click here[/url] and follow for more reviews of VR titles. And [url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/HonestVR/]Click here[/url] if you want to request reviews on other VR titles.",
